#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Vibepollo Installer & Updater — Stable, Pre-release & Nightly GUI/CLI with SHA-256 verification and 1-click rollback.

Installs or updates Vibepollo (https://github.com/Nonary/Vibepollo) on Arch Linux and Arch-based
distributions (EndeavourOS, CachyOS, Manjaro, SteamOS). Upstream's Linux beta ships only an
x86_64 pacman package. Debian, Fedora, AppImage, and Flatpak builds are not published, so this
tool refuses to install on those distros instead of pretending a package exists.

- Checks official GitHub releases across Stable, Pre-release (beta, RC or nightly), Beta, and Nightly channels.
- Lists every release, pre-releases included, so any specific version can be installed (`--list`, `--install-version`).
- Matches the official x86_64 Arch package (`vibepollo-*-x86_64.pkg.tar.zst`).
- Verifies the GitHub-attested SHA-256 digest before installing (refuses on mismatch).
- Installs via `pkexec pacman -U` in GUI mode or `sudo pacman -U` in CLI mode.
- Keeps the last 3 verified packages cached in `~/.cache/vibepollo-updater/` for 1-click rollback.
"""
from __future__ import annotations

